OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies charges over synagogue
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn alleged "close associate" of the
OL,7,FManchester synagogue knife attacker has
OL,8,Fdenied failing to disclose information
OL,9,Fin relation to the terror attack.
OL,11,FWorshippers Melvin Cravitz and Adrian
OL,12,FDaulby were killed when Jihad
OL,13,FAl-Shamie, 35, drove into the gates of
OL,14,Fthe Heaton Park Hebrew Congregation
OL,15,FSynagogue in October last year, and
OL,16,Fthen began attacking with a knife,
OL,17,Fwearing a fake suicide belt.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
