OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies charges over synagogue
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FHekmat Ali Hakim, 49, of Salford,
OL,7,FGreater Manchester, appeared via video
OL,8,Flink from prison at the Old Bailey on
OL,9,FFriday and pleaded not guilty to
OL,10,Ffailing to disclose information.
OL,12,FProsecutor Jonathan Polnay KC said the
OL,13,FIraqi national was a "close associate
OL,14,Fof Jihad Al-Shamie, who carried out a
OL,15,Fterrorist attack at a synagogue in
OL,16,FManchester".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
